  "historyNote": "#5668, eff 7-19-93; ss by #6366, eff 10-30-96, EXPIRED: 10-30-04 New. #8206, INTERIM, eff 11-18-04, EXPIRED: 5-17-05 New. #8583, eff 3-15-06; ss by #10649, eff 7-26-14",
